      <div type="clause" n="4">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">(XLVIII} Ciricsceattas sin agifene be sancte Martines mæssan; gif hwa ðæt ne gelæste, sie he scyldig LX sciƚƚ ⁊ be XIIfealdum agife þone ciricsceat.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Church dues are to be given by St. Martin’s Mass; if someone neglects this, let him be liable for [a fine of] 60 shillings and let him render the church dues twelve-fold.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">Church dues shall be rendered at Martinmas. If anyone fails to do so, he shall forfeit 60 shillings and render 12 times the church dues [in addition].</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ciricsceattas syn agifene be sc̄e Martines mæssan; gif hwa ðæt ne gelæste, sy he scyldig LX scll' ⁊ be XIIfealdum agife Done ciricsceat.</ab>
      </div>
